    "conventionNote": "MEASURED at bake time. The room rig shares houseIsoRig's camBasis/projVert — checked per facing by InteriorRigAzimuthProbe.ProjectionsAgree, not read off a header — so it turns the same way and the correction is already applied to the sheet: cell i genuinely depicts +45*i. ⚠️ Do NOT run BuildingRigAzimuthProbe on this rig: it infers handedness from which side the DOOR lands on and assumes the door is on the +Y gable, which is true of the exterior rigs and false here.",
